Z||000000||Black88GT||03-26-2001||01:37 PM||||Fiero Store's price is a little high for a fuel pressure gauge so I went over to <A HREF="http://www.jegs.com" TARGET=_blank>www.jegs.com</A>  and saw a Hypertech one, part "533-4004 Pressure Gauge" says it will need to be used with AFPR and listed the TPI camaro to work, but didn't say if the AFPR had to be a Hypertech or not.  I have a Holley.  So, will this gauge work?<P>TIA<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD - MAFOA<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://88database.homestead.com/files/AF.gif"> ||||reg||5
